   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women&#x2019;s Rights Programme in Kenya, implemented by ActionAid and local partners aims to strengthen the policy environment so that it is more supportive of women&apos;s rights and gender justice. The main objective is to demand for policy content to reflect women&apos;s needs and priorities through reflecting analysis, testimonies and advocacy asks in the policy development. Objective: policy content reflects women&apos;s needs and priorities. Outcome: Crosscutting outcome - There is a supportive policy environment for women&apos;s rights and gender justice.</narrative>
  </description>
